#. VoiceOver only: the Cancel button under the block confirm. {name} is a person's name as they typed it: never inflect it. Their gender is unknown, so avoid a gendered past tense; use a present tense, a passive or a label form.
#: src/screens/NotificationsScreen.tsx
msgid "Cancel blocking {name}"
msgstr "Avbryt blokkering av {name}"

#. VoiceOver only: the Cancel button under the Delete account confirm.
#: src/screens/AccountScreen.tsx
msgid "Cancel deleting account"
msgstr "Avbryt sletting av konto"

#. VoiceOver only: the Cancel button under the name being edited.
#: src/screens/AccountScreen.tsx
msgid "Cancel editing name"
msgstr "Avbryt redigering av navn"

#. Under the title when a search finds nothing.
#: src/lib/searchCopy.ts
msgid "Check the spelling, or try fewer letters."
msgstr "Sjekk stavemåten, eller prøv med færre bokstaver."

#. Title of the screen where the person types the code that was emailed to them.
#: src/screens/SignInScreen.tsx
msgid "Check your email"
msgstr "Sjekk e-posten din"

#. The browser tab's title on web while a new account picks the name other people see.
#: src/navigation/RootNavigator.tsx
msgid "Choose a name"
msgstr "Velg et navn"

#. VoiceOver only: the × button in the search field, which empties it.
#: src/components/SearchField.tsx
msgid "Clear search"
msgstr "Tøm søk"

#. VoiceOver only: the button that confirms blocking someone. {name} is a person's name as they typed it: never inflect it. Their gender is unknown, so avoid a gendered past tense; use a present tense, a passive or a label form.
#: src/screens/NotificationsScreen.tsx
msgid "Confirm block {name}"
msgstr "Bekreft blokkering av {name}"

#. VoiceOver only: the button that confirms deleting the account.
#: src/screens/AccountScreen.tsx
msgid "Confirm delete account"
msgstr "Bekreft sletting av konto"

#. VoiceOver only: the button that confirms leaving a list.
#: src/screens/SharingScreen.tsx
msgid "Confirm leave list"
msgstr "Bekreft at du forlater listen"

#. VoiceOver only: the button that confirms removing someone from a list. {name} is a person's name as they typed it: never inflect it. Their gender is unknown, so avoid a gendered past tense.
#: src/screens/SharingScreen.tsx
msgid "Confirm remove {name}"
msgstr "Bekreft fjerning av {name}"

#. VoiceOver only: the button that confirms signing out of every device.
#: src/screens/AccountScreen.tsx
msgid "Confirm sign out of all devices"
msgstr "Bekreft utlogging av alle enheter"

#. VoiceOver only: the button that confirms withdrawing an invitation. {name} is a person's name as they typed it: never inflect it. Their gender is unknown, so avoid a gendered past tense. Phrase it so the name needs no ending.
#: src/screens/SharingScreen.tsx
msgid "Confirm withdraw {name}'s invitation"
msgstr "Bekreft tilbaketrekking av invitasjonen til {name}"

#. Button under the name field: saves the name and goes on into the app. A full-width button.
#: src/screens/SetNameScreen.tsx
msgid "Continue"
msgstr "Fortsett"

#. VoiceOver only: Apple's own sign-in button, whose visible words Apple draws in the device's language. Use Apple's wording for this button.
#: src/screens/SignInScreen.tsx
msgid "Continue with Apple"
msgstr "Fortsett med Apple"

#. Button that signs in with a Google account. Use Google's usual wording for this button.
#: src/screens/SignInScreen.tsx
msgid "Continue with Google"
msgstr "Fortsett med Google"

#. Shown when the lists could not be read.
