#: src/screens/AccountScreen.tsx
msgid "This address hides your real email. On another iPhone, use Sign in with Apple. On Android or the web, sign in with this address, and Apple forwards the code to your inbox."
msgstr "Denne adressen skjuler den ekte e-postadressen din. På en annen iPhone bruker du Logg på med Apple. På Android eller nettet logger du på med denne adressen, og Apple videresender koden til innboksen din."

#. A refusal from the server on the Notifications or Sharing screen: the invitation was already answered or withdrawn. The English is the database's own words, lowercase with no full stop: write a natural sentence, capitalised and punctuated as your language's UI would be.
#: src/lib/serverMessages.ts
msgid "this invitation is no longer open"
msgstr "Denne invitasjonen er ikke lenger åpen."

