#: src/lib/serverMessages.ts
msgid "this list has been deleted"
msgstr "Denne listen er slettet."

#. A refusal from the server on the Sharing screen: nobody can be invited to a list in the bin. "the bin" is where deleted lists wait 30 days. The English is the database's own words, lowercase with no full stop: write a natural sentence, capitalised and punctuated as your language's UI would be.
#: src/lib/serverMessages.ts
msgid "this list is in the bin"
msgstr "Denne listen ligger i papirkurven."

#. On a deleted list's own screen. “Show deleted” is the switch of that name: use its translation.
#: src/screens/ListDetailScreen.tsx
msgid "This list is in the bin. Restoring it brings back everything except the items you deleted separately — those are one tick of Show deleted away."
msgstr "Denne listen ligger i papirkurven. Gjenoppretter du den, får du tilbake alt unntatt varene du slettet hver for seg – dem finner du med ett trykk på Vis slettede."

